Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Turneul de arte marțiale}
Comment: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:17.58,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Lu, K.K. și Prințul}
Comment: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:21.78,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Planeta Arahasu}
Comment: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:45.35,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Schimbul}
Comment: 0,0:24:47.05,0:24:47.09,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{Complotul dejucat}
Comment: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:20.20,Dialogue,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În acest mare turneu de arte marțiale, \Nunde fiecare își etalează abilitățile,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.49,0:00:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,lovitura finală va fi dată în \Ntimpul unei lupte nebune!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.15,0:01:27.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar acum, va avea loc \Nrunda finală a turneului!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.40,0:01:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Într-un colț, câștigătorul ultimei runde, \Ntunul dezlănțuit ce-i ciocănește pe toți,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.12,0:01:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Distrugătorul Om-ciocan!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.29,0:01:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar în colțul opus, \Ndin armata demonică Anman,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.00,0:01:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armagedonul însuși, \NRobotul K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.46,0:01:42.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.92,0:01:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar e permis așa ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.96,0:01:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce treabă are el \Ncu artele marțiale?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt permise armele de foc cât \Ntimp sunt folosite de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.84,0:01:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu încalcă nicio regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.93,0:01:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, moșule,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu-ți face griji dacă lupta e corectă \Nsau nu. Fă-ți griji pentru tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.39,0:01:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot îndrugi acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.77,0:01:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te voi face praf!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În regulă! Lupta va \Nîncepe în 30 de secunde!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.31,0:02:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-a dat startul la numărătoarea inversă!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.16,0:02:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luptați!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.49,0:02:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rog să așteptați!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.37,0:02:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Ei bine, și eu vreau...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și eu vreau să particip!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce naiba crezi că faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar luptătorii au voie în ring!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.98,0:02:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să fac un tur al galaxiei.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.15,0:02:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să fac un \Ntur al galaxiei!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, domnișoară, dacă vrei \Nsă iei parte la turul galexiei,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.62,0:02:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,trebuie să câștigi turneul.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta înseamnă să \Nte lupți cu {\i1}acei{\i0} tipi!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.83,0:03:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicio problemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.87,0:03:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă voi lupta cu ei!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.79,0:03:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucrurile devin interesante!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.17,0:03:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțimea râde de apariția de \Nnicăieri a unei noi „luptătoare”!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.25,0:03:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-La naiba, de ce a trebuit să \Napară această fată țăcănită?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.92,0:03:13.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Du-te acasă înainte \Nsă faci buba!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bănuiesc că tu \Nvei fi primul, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.81,0:03:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uimitor! Ce fată \Nplină de energie!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.27,0:03:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nici măcar mărețului \NOm-ciocan nu-i vine să creadă!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.69,0:03:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce a fost acel pumn? \NN-Nu-mi vine să cred...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.32,0:03:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi pasă dacă \Nești doar o fetiță,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,oricine mă lovește o pățește!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.94,0:03:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-a zis cu tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.78,0:03:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-a ferit!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E rândului lui Lu acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și Lu a câștigat!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Măi să fie!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.25,0:03:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Invincibilul Om-ciocan \Na fost făcut praf de o fetiță!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.67,0:03:54.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar acum, tu urmezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide să vedem de \Nce ești în stare!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Stai puțin. Poate nu pare, \Ndar sunt feminist.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.89,0:04:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă pot bate cu o fată!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Asta e cumva scuza ta \Nca să nu te lupți cu mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.73,0:04:05.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu, eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.85,0:04:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu vreau să mă lupt cu fete.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.52,0:04:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu voi accepta asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.48,0:04:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă voi lupta cu tine, domnule, \Nși voi merge într-un tur al galaxiei!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.74,0:04:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar eu nu vreau \Nsă mă lupt cu tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ba da!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ba nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ba da...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rezultatul meciului a fost decis.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Câștigătorul este... ea!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, moșule, ești \Nsigur că te simți bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.97,0:04:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum naiba de sunt \N{\i1}eu{\i0} pierzătorul?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pentru că așa am decis eu.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.53,0:04:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rugăm să fiți atenți!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.61,0:05:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Câștigătorul din acest an al Turneului Imperial \Nde Arte Marțiale este fata-elf înaripată!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să începem acum \Nceremonia de premiere.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.33,0:05:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.87,0:05:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.95,0:05:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.87,0:05:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să câștig așa!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă nu m-am luptat \Ncu acest domn!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.54,0:05:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă bucură deloc dacă sunt \Ndeclarată câștigătoare pur și simplu!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.76,0:05:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, așteaptă!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și Lu a câștigat din nou!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.39,0:05:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce zâmbet de învingătoare!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim, domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.69,0:05:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca dovadă a victoriei tale, \Nîți înmânăm certificatul pentru călătorie.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.81,0:05:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteptați puțin!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am pierdut încă!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.49,0:05:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești primul care a reușit să \Nse ridice după ce l-am lovit!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cât de tare!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.21,0:05:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Termină cu prostiile!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.08,0:05:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu am fost drăguț cu tine, \Niar tu ai profitat de asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate ești fată, dar dacă vei continua \Nsă mă iei peste picior, atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, am înțeles acum. \NSunteți cu toții în cârdășie!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.93,0:06:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă lăudați cu marele vostru \Nturneu de arte marțiale,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.39,0:06:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar totul a fost aranjat dinainte!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.10,0:06:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V-am prins cu mâța în sac!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum îndrăznești \Nsă spui așa ceva?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.73,0:06:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai idee cu cine vorbești măcar?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.94,0:06:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gura!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă voi face praf!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?! Cum a reușit \Nsă se ferească?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.91,0:06:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba, știam eu \Ncă e o înșelătorie!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucrurile au luat-o razna!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.40,0:07:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Costumul Robotului K.K. \Na scăpat de sub control!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.74,0:07:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Puterea sa de foc a transformat\N Stadionul Abi într-un infern!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunteți bine, Alteță?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alteță! Alteță!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.55,0:07:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.92,0:07:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde, arde... Flăcările roșii \Nmerg bine cu vinul meu roșu.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.26,0:07:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce priveliște magnifică.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să mă prezint.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.97,0:07:31.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnișoară, eu sunt Muscat Tylor, \Nprinț al Imperiului Galactic.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.81,0:07:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prinț?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.89,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-am dorit să vizitez \Nîn secret Imperiul.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.06,0:07:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am organizat turneul de arte marțiale \Npentru a-mi găsi companioni de călatorie.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.86,0:07:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, în runda finală,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.86,0:07:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,rămăseseră doar două \Ncapete pătrate, necioplite.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.57,0:07:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și exact când era să-mi pierd \Ntot interesul, ai apărut tu.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asta te-am declarat câștigătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai vreo întrebare?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să ții secret \Ndiscuția dintre noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.63,0:08:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi voi putea folosi autoritatea în această călătorie, dar voi suporta toate cheltuielile.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.55,0:08:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și nici nu știu când \Nne vom întoarce.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încă mai dorești să vii?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.47,0:08:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, doresc!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.76,0:08:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fost mereu visul meu să \Nvizitez tot felul de planete!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.89,0:08:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.89,0:08:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino mâine la Blocul 101 \Nde la Aeroportul Național.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi avea pașaportul tău pregătit.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.44,0:08:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteptați.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lupta nu s-a terminat încă.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.53,0:08:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu din nou!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.66,0:08:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă voi da bătut \Natât de ușor.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.03,0:08:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt genul de tip care duce \Nlucrurile până la capăt.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să te văd!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, vai. Ce surpriză neașteptată.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai văzut asta, moșule?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.59,0:08:46.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am folosit un amestec de \Ncătușnică și crizantemă.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.88,0:08:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu afectează oamenii, \Ndar merge de minune asupra elfilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.10,0:08:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Felicitări!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.47,0:08:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foarte bine, K.K., \Nm-ai făcut să mă răzgândesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă voi lua pe {\i1}amândoi{\i0} cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.31,0:08:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi avea mâine și pașaportul tău \Npregătit pentru turul galaxiei.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vrei să afli mai multe, \Nîntreab-o pe ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.65,0:09:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încercați să vă înțelegeți.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.07,0:09:06.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hei! Așteaptă puțin, moșule!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.70,0:09:08.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moșule! Moșule!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Presupun că îi voi pune ei întrebări \Npeste cinci ore când se va trezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.83,0:09:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.32,0:09:51.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și așa am ajuns să \Nfac un tur al galaxiei.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.66,0:09:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Domnul Muscat este un bărbat înalt, \Nchipeș, bogat și foarte important.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.54,0:10:01.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}K.K. este un băiat urât, rău, \Nprost și complet neimportant.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.17,0:10:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mamă, tată, vă voi scrie curând, \Nașa că aveți grijă de voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.80,0:10:13.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba faceți?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.26,0:10:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să vă uitați la o fată când \Nse spală e deja prea mult!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:17.31,0:10:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot spui acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.52,0:10:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai ieșeai de acolo,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că am venit să te verificăm, \Ndeoarece eram îngrijorați.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai minți!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.36,0:10:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu ai răspuns deloc, \Noricât te-am strigat,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,deci am crezut că...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.99,0:10:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Minți, minți!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.86,0:10:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar voiai să mă vezi goală!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.95,0:10:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu fi proastă!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine ar vrea să se uite \Nla o scândură ca tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu{\i0} sunt o scândură!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pieptul meu a crescut \Ncu 3 cm anul acesta!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.58,0:10:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, ține-o tot așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.46,0:10:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu cred că vei mai putea \Nzbura dacă vei mai crește mult!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.80,0:10:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.09,0:10:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.84,0:10:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să ne batem?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,HEI!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.05,0:10:51.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A început să-mi fie foame.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.51,0:10:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aș dori să mă însoțiți la cină.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.51,0:10:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ura, mâncare!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.39,0:11:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arată așa de bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.81,0:11:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt uimită. Știți și \Nsă gătiți, domnule șofer?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.11,0:11:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă flatezi, domnișoară Lu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.69,0:11:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun. Să mâncăm acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.49,0:11:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftă bună!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E delicios!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.36,0:11:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce aromă minunată.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.83,0:11:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E foarte bun, moșule.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.29,0:11:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă bucur că vă place.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi lua eu acest tofu!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi lua eu acești tăieței!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.33,0:11:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Carne, carne!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, tu mănânci doar carne!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E asta o problemă? \NNu fi zgârcită.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar și eu vreau!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te vei îngrășa dacă vei \Ncontinua să bagi în tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.76,0:11:31.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poftim?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ai—
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.05,0:11:36.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.80,0:11:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Merg să verific.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu! Motorul nu mai \Nrăspunde la comenzi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.90,0:11:48.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vom continua să accelerăm, \Nvom face un hiper-salt!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.61,0:11:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu reușesc să stabilizez motorul. \NCoordonatele destinației sunt incerte.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.11,0:11:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, ce vrei, șoferule?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.03,0:11:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Că nu știm unde vom ajunge?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.53,0:11:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă. Oricum nu \Naveam o destinație în minte.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haideți să ne \Nlăsăm purtați de val!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, asta sună distractiv!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.73,0:12:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceea e o navă spațială!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.56,0:12:27.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O navă spațială!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.05,0:12:54.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, cum naiba s-a \Nîntâmplat una ca asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.42,0:12:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E foarte ciudat. Totul era în regulă \Ncând am verificat de dimineață.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oprește-te, K.K.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.39,0:13:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gata, gata. \NTotul e în regulă, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.18,0:13:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ce ne facem acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine... Salutare!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.39,0:13:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunteți călători, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, așa este.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Noi suntem dintr-un \Nsat din apropiere.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.48,0:13:16.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că aveți niște necazuri. \NVă putem ajuta?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta ar fi perfect!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.20,0:13:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumim!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, un tur interplanetar?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.50,0:13:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da. Eu sunt Muscat Tylor, un om de afaceri \Ncu magazine de haine în tot Imperiul.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.30,0:13:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt K.K.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar eu sunt Lu!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt șoferul lor.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.47,0:13:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne-am prăbușit din \Ngreșeală pe această planetă,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.81,0:13:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar cred că ne-ar plăcea s-o \Nvizităm puțin dacă tot suntem aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aveți locații istorice?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.93,0:13:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Ei bine, planeta Arahasu e formată în mare \Ndin nisip și pietre, deci nu prea aveți ce vedea.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu le arătați ruinele?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.69,0:13:55.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,Ah, bătrânule.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.86,0:14:00.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dragi oaspeți, există niște ruine \Nfoarte misterioase în apropiere.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi fi încântat să vi le arăt.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumim.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.91,0:14:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acestea sunt ruinele unui templu dedicat idolilor antici.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se află în vârful acestui deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iată-ne ajunși.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredibil!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.01,0:14:25.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt acelea statui ale lui Bacchus?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.76,0:14:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bacchus?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.64,0:14:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da. Bacchus, numit uneori și Dionysos.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:29.35,0:14:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este zeul vinului.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.97,0:14:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Discul de pe capul lui este o aureolă.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.06,0:14:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta înseamnă că este o divinitate sacră.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aureolă?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ea creează lumina pe care o vezi\N în spatele unui zeu.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.11,0:14:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sticla rotundă pe care o ține provine dintr-o ceremonie antică.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.36,0:14:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și ce e chestia aceea ca o scândură?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.99,0:14:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aceea este cartea în care erau consemnate păcatele\N celor vii.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.87,0:14:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când oamenii mureau,\N se decidea dacă mergeau în Rai
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,în funcție de cât păcătuiseră.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.59,0:14:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta credeau adepții lui Bacchus.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau, chiar știi multe, K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, nu chiar atât de multe.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, bravo, bravo. Cu adevărat magnific.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.93,0:15:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că ești foarte priceput la istoria antică, tinere.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.93,0:15:08.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca semn de respect,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.68,0:15:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,îți voi arăta ceva\N văzut de foarte puțini.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.64,0:15:13.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Comoara templului vinului.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe aici, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei K.K., ce-i chestia aia?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Aia... este... ceva foarte important!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.45,0:15:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ceva foarte important?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hai, odată!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta este sarcofagul sacru al templului vinului.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.71,0:15:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este interzis să scoți conținutul său\N din templu.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Străinilor le este interzis să-l atingă,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iar în sute de ani,\N clanul nostru nu i-a aruncat niciodată măcar o privire.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce chestie uimitoare!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.01,0:15:47.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bătrânule, ești sigur că e o idee bună\N să le arăți ceva atât de valoros?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.56,0:15:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.93,0:15:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,După cum vezi, acest sarcofag este acoperit\N de o singură piatră uriașă.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.89,0:16:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar fi imposibil să o miști și să fugi cu comoara!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că ai dreptate.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.93,0:16:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde te duci, K.K.?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.89,0:16:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu asta e calea spre toaletă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.06,0:16:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tontule. Cine se duce acolo?\N Eu mă duc la templu.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.98,0:16:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La templu?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.77,0:16:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să văd comoara lor de neatins.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.06,0:16:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cu costumul meu de putere,\N probabil că pot să mut capacul.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu poți, K.K. O să fii certat!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.28,0:16:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și tu vrei să o vezi, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am reușit! S-a deschis!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.15,0:17:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredibil!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este o încăpere de depozitare.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.07,0:17:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta este vinul legendar pe care preotesele\N lui Bacchus îl foloseau la sărbătorile lor.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.28,0:17:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să fie!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.91,0:17:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine-i acolo?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Stați, vă rog!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.21,0:17:39.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt doar eu, vedeți?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, dumneavoastră sunteți, domnule Șofer.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.54,0:17:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ne speriați așa.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta spun și eu!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.01,0:17:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar sigur ați găsit\N ceva incredibil aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.55,0:17:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O descoperire arheologică uimitoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.22,0:17:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă publicăm asta, savanții se vor călca în picioare de uimire!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va trebui să vedem noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.98,0:17:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.77,0:17:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te mișca, domnișoară Lu.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnule Șofer.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.73,0:18:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vă faceți griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.02,0:18:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este doar un paralizant.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.57,0:18:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este {\i1}cam{\i0} puternic, totuși.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.69,0:18:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.53,0:18:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De mult timp caut\N comoara legendară a lui Arahasu.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.49,0:18:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Odată ce o vând, voi fi bogat.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adică tu\fscx400-
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.54,0:18:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exact. Am făcut nava spațială\N să se strice intenționat.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Intenționam să vin\N pe planeta asta încă de la început.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.34,0:18:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și știam că învingătorul concursului de arte marțiale\N va putea ridica capacul.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.13,0:18:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am făcut deja aranjamente cu un grup\N de negustori. Vor ajunge în curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.39,0:18:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă le pot vinde acest vin sacru,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.68,0:18:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,voi trăi ca un rege\N tot restul zilelor mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar asta e greșit!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.31,0:18:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vinul acela aparține acestui loc.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e greșit!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.28,0:18:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va trebui doar să tragi\N un pui de somn câteva zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.25,0:19:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hai-hui!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, deci...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salutări.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.78,0:19:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iată-l, legendarul vin sacru din Arahasu!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este pe bune.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.62,0:19:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, asta e fantastic.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grăbiți-vă! Încărcați-le!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.70,0:19:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, despre plata mea...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.87,0:19:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, da. Ce ziceți de asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.42,0:19:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ticăloșilor! M-ați păcălit!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-avem bani pentru tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.09,0:19:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai făcut treabă bună, totuși.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.28,0:19:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.51,0:19:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Țintește!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.81,0:20:03.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați vinul înapoi chiar acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vinul ăla aparține sătenilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.94,0:20:06.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-l înapoi!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.89,0:20:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnișoara Lu!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce-i cu fata aia?! Foc!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai înțeles acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă vinul înapoi!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-vă la o parte.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-ai nicio șansă împotriva ei.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.09,0:20:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E elfă.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.88,0:20:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fetițo, eu sunt bodyguardul\N acestui grup de negustori.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.76,0:20:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu, Chilam, ucigașul a o sută de oameni,\N voi fi adversarul tău! {I hear chiramu}
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.68,0:20:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia de-asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu voi ierta pe nimeni\N care agresează o fată!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.81,0:20:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.95,0:20:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Întăriri?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia de-aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A sosit ajutorul.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.45,0:21:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am lovit-o?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, voi! Terminați-i odată!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne mai vedem!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.06,0:21:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba cu tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șoferul!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.27,0:22:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fir-ar! E blestemul!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.25,0:22:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ce naiba sunt alea?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.92,0:22:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, am dat-o în bară!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.13,0:22:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uite ce-ai făcut\N cu casa mea, fir-ar să fie!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.06,0:22:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine, K.K.?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.52,0:22:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desigur!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.73,0:22:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ceva de genul ăsta nu mă va opri!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.40,0:22:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta vine dinspre sat.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.65,0:22:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu! Trebuie să fie statuile lui Bacchus!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.24,0:23:01.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, stai!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:11.08,0:23:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce intrare grandioasă! Bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.51,0:23:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi văd!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.10,0:23:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu merg primul!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.02,0:23:34.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fir-ar, sunt puternici.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.73,0:23:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta nu funcționează.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia de-aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.94,0:23:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, nu, ce să fac?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.95,0:23:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-Aia... este... ceva foarte important!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:48.87,0:23:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:53.46,0:23:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:00.29,0:24:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, omule...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:02.25,0:24:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am reușit!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.35,0:24:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu e chiar nerușinată pentru o fată. {meaning that she hits the tanuki on their balls? penises? and is not ashamed of it}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.82,0:24:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnule Șofer!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.28,0:24:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, domnișoara Lu! Se pare că paralizantul meu\N te-a afectat foarte puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.12,0:24:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adică, a fost o glumă!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:28.83,0:24:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.99,0:24:32.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sătenii! Alteța Voastră!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:33.37,0:24:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ăă, despre butoaiele astea de vin...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.33,0:24:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare foarte rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:36.54,0:24:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Totul a început când eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.34,0:24:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, nu, foarte bine, Lu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.00,0:24:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.42,0:24:43.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, foarte bine într-adevăr.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.13,0:24:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-am fost niciodată atât de norocoși.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.01,0:24:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.51,0:24:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din legendele străvechi, eram destul de siguri
Dialogue: 99,0:24:53.77,0:24:56.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,că vinul sacru se afla în templu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar între capacul acela uriaș și statuile lui Bacchus,\N nu puteam face nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:00.90,0:25:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și tocmai când ajunseserăți\N la capătul puterilor, am apărut noi.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:05.45,0:25:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vindem vinul acela, vom deveni\N în scurt timp cel mai bogat sat de pe Arahasu.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:12.70,0:25:13.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:25.38,0:25:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În sfârșit v-am găsit, Alteța Voastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:27.59,0:25:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:28.47,0:25:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, voi sunteți!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:31.93,0:25:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toți!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înapoi!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:34.18,0:25:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aveți idee cine este acesta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:36.68,0:25:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,El este preainonoratul al 108-lea prinț al Imperiului Galactic!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:39.81,0:25:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Muscat Tylor! {această scenă, în care își arată sigiliul imperiului, este o parodie evidentă a lui Mito Komon: Episodul se încheie cu o încăierare în care protagoniștii deghizați și neînarmați înving o mulțime de samurai și gangsteri, culminând cu prezentarea inrō-ului care dezvăluie identitatea eroului. - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inro}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:42.27,0:25:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arătați-i respect!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:46.90,0:25:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,T-Tu vrei să spui că tipul ăsta {\i1}chiar este{\i0} prinț?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:49.82,0:25:52.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? V-am spus deja!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:52.45,0:25:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alteța Voastră. Majestatea Sa este îngrijorată pentru dumneavoastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:55.58,0:25:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rugăm să vă stăpâniți.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.29,0:25:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rugăm să vă întoarceți la postul dumneavoastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:59.12,0:26:01.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu bei ceva\N înainte să plecăm?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:01.29,0:26:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar noi...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:02.63,0:26:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Refuzi vinul pe care ți l-am turnat?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.55,0:26:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ă-Ăă, nu. Atunci doar o cupă.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.80,0:26:12.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vă faceți griji. Nu este fatal.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:14.06,0:26:16.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce om!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:16.39,0:26:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat, Lu, K.K.?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:17.93,0:26:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plecăm!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.02,0:26:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:23.82,0:26:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tututor, vă mulțumesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:25.69,0:26:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumim că ne-ați găzduit!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.74,0:26:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnule!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:28.65,0:26:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stați, stați!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:29.99,0:26:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă rog să mă luați și pe mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.53,0:26:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar fi rău dacă nu ați avea pe nimeni care să piloteze nava.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:34.87,0:26:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Foarte bine. Vino și tu.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:47.34,0:26:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Alteța Voastră!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:55.35,0:26:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și acum, încotro ne îndreptăm?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:57.77,0:27:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să merg undeva\N cu multă mâncare delicioasă!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:00.44,0:27:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să mă lupt cu monștri\N în costumul meu de putere!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:04.36,0:27:07.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e nevoie să fii nerăbdător. \NCălătoria noastră abia a început.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:07.03,0:27:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suntem într-o croazieră prin galaxie!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:08.94,0:27:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toată lumea, cu toții împreună!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.40,0:27:12.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:04.90,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1800)\c&H090C00&\t(0,900,1,\c&HCC9962&)\pos(730,880)}ÎN IMPERIUL GALATIC
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.05,0:06:38.30,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Nu, nu, rău, rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.30,0:06:40.84,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, Lu, fata puternică)
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.97,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Nu ești un băiat rău?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.97,0:06:45.39,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, Lu, fata puternică)
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.72,0:06:49.68,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Ține-ți pentru tine inima năzuroasă și intențiile ascunse
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.43,0:06:53.90,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,păstrează-le pentru tine
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.48,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Nu, nu, ce scârbos, ce scârbos!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.48,0:07:00.15,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, Lu, fata puternică)
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.15,0:07:02.28,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Nu ești un băiat precoce?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.28,0:07:04.99,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, Lu, fata puternică)
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.99,0:07:09.45,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,De ce sunt bărbații, toți,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.45,0:07:13.50,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,atât de afemeiați?
