Dialogue: 99,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In this great martial arts tournament,\N where everyone has invested their skill,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:49.49,0:00:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the final blow will be struck\N in the midst of wild excitement!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.15,0:01:27.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, we enter the final round of the main tournament!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:27.40,0:01:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In one corner, last round's victor,\N the loose cannon with the fighting hammer,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.12,0:01:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hammerman the Destroyer!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:34.29,0:01:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And in the other corner,\N from the devilish Anman army,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.00,0:01:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the one-man Armageddon himself,\N K.K. Mechanical Device!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.46,0:01:42.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:42.92,0:01:43.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that allowed?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.96,0:01:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's he got to do with martial arts?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Personally controlled ranged weapons are permitted.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.84,0:01:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He hasn't broken any rules.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.93,0:01:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, gramps,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't worry about it being a fair fight.\N Worry about yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.39,0:01:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you blabbering about?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.77,0:01:58.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll effing kill you!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, 30 seconds until the fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.31,0:02:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The countdown has begun!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:11.16,0:02:12.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.49,0:02:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.37,0:02:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, um, I wanna...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna take part too!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only fighters are allowed in the ring!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.98,0:02:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.98,0:02:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go on a tour of the galaxy.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.15,0:02:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go on a tour of the galaxy!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.36,0:02:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, miss, if you want\N to go on the tour,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.62,0:02:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'd have to win the tournament.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means fighting {\i1}those{\i0} guys!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.83,0:03:00.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.87,0:03:02.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fight them!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.79,0:03:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is getting interesting!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.17,0:03:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The crowd is laughing at the sudden appearance of a new challenger!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.25,0:03:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Damn, why did this crazy girl\N have to show up?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.92,0:03:13.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, little lady.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go home before you get hurt!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about I start with you, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.81,0:03:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! What a spirited girl!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.27,0:03:23.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even the great Hammerman is stunned!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.69,0:03:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that punch? I-Impossible... {bakana}
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.32,0:03:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a little girl,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,anyone who hits me is gonna get it!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.94,0:03:31.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.78,0:03:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She dodged it!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu's going in!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.91,0:03:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu wins!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.21,0:03:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you say to that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.25,0:03:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The invincible Hammerman has been crushed by a little girl!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.67,0:03:54.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, your turn.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon, test your strength against me!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on. I might not look like it, but I'm a feminist.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.89,0:04:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't fight a girl!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, is this an excuse not to fight me?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.73,0:04:05.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.56,0:04:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.85,0:04:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't wanna fight girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.52,0:04:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.48,0:04:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight you, Mister,\N and go on a tour of the galaxy!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.74,0:04:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not fighting you!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.11,0:04:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I say you are!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I say I'm not!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, you{\fscx400}-
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This match has been decided.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This round's winner... is her!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.55,0:04:38.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, you sure you're feelin' all right?{dc: rephrase closer to jp}
Dialogue: 99,0:04:38.97,0:04:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How in hell did I {\i1}lose{\i0} that match?!{dc: again, closer to jp}
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I said so.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.53,0:04:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your attention, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.61,0:05:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The winner of this year's Imperial Martial Arts Tournament is the winged elf girl!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's proceed\N to the award ceremony.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.33,0:05:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.87,0:05:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.95,0:05:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.87,0:05:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want it!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.75,0:05:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't even fought this guy yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.54,0:05:15.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just being declared the winner\N doesn't make me happy at all!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.76,0:05:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu wins again!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.39,0:05:24.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, bravo! Bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a winning smile!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, miss.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:27.69,0:05:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a sign of your victory,\N here is the certificate for your trip.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.81,0:05:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.44,0:05:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not down for the count yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.49,0:05:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the first person who's been able\N to stand up after I kicked them!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.21,0:05:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quit screwing around!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.08,0:05:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was being nice,\N and you took advantage of it!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be a girl, but if you keep making fun of me, I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. You're all in on this!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.93,0:06:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You talk big about this Imperial Martial Arts Tournament,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.39,0:06:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it was rigged all along!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.10,0:06:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.73,0:06:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who you're speaking to?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.94,0:06:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! How did she dodge that?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.05,0:06:38.30,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,No, no, bad, bad!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.30,0:06:40.84,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, strong girl Lu)
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.97,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a bad man?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.97,0:06:45.39,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, strong girl Lu)
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.72,0:06:49.68,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Keep your naughty heart and ulterior motives
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.43,0:06:53.90,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,To yourself
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.48,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,No, no, gross, gross!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.48,0:07:00.15,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, strong girl Lu)
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.15,0:07:02.28,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a precocious boy?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.28,0:07:04.99,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,(Lu Lu Lu, strong girl Lu)
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.99,0:07:09.45,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Why is it that men, all of them
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.45,0:07:13.50,ED-E 2,,0,0,0,,Are so lecherous?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.91,0:06:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, I knew this was all a setup!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has turned into a disaster!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.40,0:07:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K.K. Mechanical Device's\N power suit is out of control!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.74,0:07:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its firepower has turned\N Abi Stadium into an inferno!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Highness! Your Highness!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.55,0:07:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.92,0:07:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burning, burning... Red flames pair well with red wine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.26,0:07:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent sight.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should introduce myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.97,0:07:31.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss, I am Muscat Tylor,\N a prince of the Galactic Empire.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.81,0:07:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A prince?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.89,0:07:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wished to tour the Empire in secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.06,0:07:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I held the martial arts tournament\N in order to find companions for my trip.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:40.86,0:07:42.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, by the final round,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.86,0:07:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the only ones left were a couple\N of inelegant, muscle-brained fools.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.57,0:07:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you came along, \Nright as I was about to lose all interest.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I declared you the winner.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any questions?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.08,0:07:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to keep\N this conversation a secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.63,0:08:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the trip, I cannot use my imperial authority, so I'll pay for any expenses.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:02.55,0:08:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know when we'll be returning\N from this journey.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you still want to come along?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.47,0:08:07.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll go!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.76,0:08:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been my life-long dream to visit\N all sorts of different planets!\N
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.89,0:08:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:12.89,0:08:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to Block 101\N at the National Airport tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.06,0:08:17.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll issue your passport.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.44,0:08:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.73,0:08:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you two.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This fight isn't over yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.53,0:08:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.66,0:08:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going down that easily.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.03,0:08:32.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the kind of guy \Nthat has to see things through.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.37,0:08:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.46,0:08:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See that, old man?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.59,0:08:46.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a mixture of silver vine and chrysanthemum.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.88,0:08:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't affect humans, \Nbut it works like a charm on elves.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.10,0:08:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.47,0:08:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, K.K., you've made me\N change my mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.43,0:08:55.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take you {\i1}and{\i0} the girl with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.31,0:08:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll issue you a passport for the galactic tour as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to know more,\N just ask her.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.65,0:09:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't fight, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.07,0:09:06.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Wait up, old man!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.70,0:09:08.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Old man! Old man!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll ask her\N when she wakes up in five hours.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.83,0:09:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.32,0:09:51.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So basically, that's how I got\N to go on a tour of the galaxy.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.66,0:09:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Muscat is a tall, handsome, rich, and important man.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.54,0:10:01.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}K.K. is an ugly, mean, stupid, \Nand not-in-the-least-important boy.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:01.17,0:10:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until I write again, Mom and Dad,\N please take care of yourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.80,0:10:13.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.26,0:10:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Peeking on a girl in the bath\N is going too far!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:17.31,0:10:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.52,0:10:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were taking so long in there,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.39,0:10:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we got worried and came over to check on you.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an excuse!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:23.36,0:10:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't answer,\N no matter how much we called,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.07,0:10:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I started to think{\fscx400}-
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.99,0:10:28.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lies, lies!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.86,0:10:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just wanted to see me naked!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.95,0:10:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who'd wanna see your scrawny body, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am {\i1}not{\i0} scrawny!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My bust already got 3 cm bigger this year!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.58,0:10:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heh. You just keep on growing like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.46,0:10:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, if you keep getting bigger,\N your wings won't be able to hold you up!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.80,0:10:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.09,0:10:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.84,0:10:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.05,0:10:51.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have become rather hungry.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.51,0:10:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like it if you would both join me for dinner.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.51,0:10:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's eat!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.39,0:11:01.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That looks delicious!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.81,0:11:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Driver, you can cook too? Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.11,0:11:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You flatter me, Miss Lu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.69,0:11:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, shall we eat?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.49,0:11:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:15.36,0:11:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mmm. What a wonderful taste.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:16.83,0:11:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is good stuff, gramps.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.29,0:11:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you like it.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This tofu is mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This shirataki is mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:22.33,0:11:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's meat, meat!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're just taking meat!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, right? Don't be stingy.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to eat some too!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get fat\N if you stuff yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.76,0:11:31.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did{\fscx400}-
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.05,0:11:36.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.80,0:11:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go check.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The engine is out of control!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.90,0:11:48.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we keep accelerating like this,\Nwe're going to warp!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.61,0:11:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Engine output uncontrollable.\NCoordinates can't be set.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.11,0:11:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that, driver?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.03,0:11:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean we don't know\N where we're gonna warp to?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.53,0:11:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine. We're going\N where we feel like anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just go with the flow!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, that sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.73,0:12:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a spaceship!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.56,0:12:27.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spaceship!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.05,0:12:54.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, how the hell did this happen?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.42,0:12:58.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange. Everything was all right\N when I checked it this morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it, K.K.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.39,0:13:02.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now. This is perfectly fine, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.18,0:13:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what are we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:04.60,0:13:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello there!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:06.39,0:13:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From what I can see, you are travelers.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are from a nearby village.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.48,0:13:16.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to be in some trouble.\N Should we help you?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'd be quite dandy!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.20,0:13:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, an interplanetary tour?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:30.50,0:13:36.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I am Muscat Tylor, a clothier with businesses all over the empire.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.30,0:13:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm K.K.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm Lu!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm their driver.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.47,0:13:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We accidentally crashed on this planet,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.81,0:13:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we might as well go sightseeing\N while we're here.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any famous\N historic sites here?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:46.93,0:13:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Planet Arahasu is mostly sand\N and rocks, so there isn't really much to see.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.90,0:13:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show them the ruins?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.69,0:13:55.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, elder.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.86,0:14:00.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honored guests, there are some very mysterious ruins nearby.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will gladly show them to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.16,0:14:03.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.91,0:14:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are the ruins of a temple dedicated to ancient idols.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.12,0:14:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are on top of this hill.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.01,0:14:25.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are those statues of Bacchus?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.76,0:14:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bacchus?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.64,0:14:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Bacchus, sometimes also called Dionysus.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:29.35,0:14:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's the god of wine.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.97,0:14:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The disk on his head is a halo.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.06,0:14:35.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's means he's a sacred deity.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Halo?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It makes the light you see\N behind a god's back.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.11,0:14:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The round bottle he's holding is from an ancient ceremony.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.36,0:14:43.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's that board-like thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.99,0:14:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the book where the sins\N of the living were recorded.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.87,0:14:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When people died, \Nwhether they went to Heaven
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was decided based on how much they had sinned.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.59,0:14:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what Bacchus' followers believed.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.09,0:14:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you sure know a lot, K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, not that much.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, bravo, bravo. Truly magnificent.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.93,0:15:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems you are well-versed\N in ancient history, young man.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.93,0:15:08.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a sign of respect,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.68,0:15:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will show you something\N few have seen.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.64,0:15:13.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The treasure of the temple of wine.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:13.85,0:15:15.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey K.K., what's that thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's... something very important!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:22.45,0:15:23.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something very important?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon already!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the sacred sarcophagus of the temple of wine.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.71,0:15:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is forbidden to take its contents\N outside of the temple.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Outsiders are forbidden to touch it,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and in hundreds of years,\N our clan has never once laid eyes on it.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Truly amazing stuff!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.01,0:15:47.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elder, are you sure it's a good idea\N to show off something so valuable?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:48.56,0:15:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.93,0:15:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, this sarcophagus is covered\N with a single massive stone.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.89,0:16:01.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be impossible to move it and run off with the treasure!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.93,0:16:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, K.K.?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.89,0:16:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the way to the toilet.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.06,0:16:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dummy. Who's going there?\NI'm going to the temple.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.98,0:16:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The temple?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.77,0:16:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to see that untouchable treasure of theirs.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.06,0:16:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With my power suit,\N I can probably move the lid.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't, K.K. You'll get scolded!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.28,0:16:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to see it too, don't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did it! It's open!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.15,0:17:26.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a storehouse.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:28.07,0:17:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the legendary wine the priestesses\N of Bacchus used in their festivals.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.28,0:17:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has to be!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:35.91,0:17:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:38.21,0:17:39.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only me, see?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Mr. Driver.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.54,0:17:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't scare us like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's my line!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:45.01,0:17:47.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you've sure found\N something amazing here.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:47.55,0:17:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An amazing archaeological find.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.22,0:17:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we publish this, scholars are going to fall over themselves in surprise!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:52.97,0:17:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to see about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.98,0:17:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.77,0:17:59.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Miss Lu.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Driver.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:01.73,0:18:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.02,0:18:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just a paralyzer.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.57,0:18:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} a bit strong, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.69,0:18:07.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.53,0:18:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been after the legendary treasure\N of Arahasu for a long time.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:13.49,0:18:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I sell it, I'll be rich.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean you{\fscx400}-
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.54,0:18:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. I made the spaceship\N break down on purpose.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I intended to come\N to this planet all along.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.34,0:18:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I knew the winner of the martial arts competition would be able to lift the lid.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.13,0:18:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already made arrangements with a group\N of traders. They'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:33.39,0:18:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can sell them this sacred wine,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.68,0:18:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll live like a king\N for the rest of my days.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.06,0:18:42.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.31,0:18:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wine belongs here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.28,0:18:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to take\N a nap for a few days.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.25,0:19:03.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heave ho!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greetings.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:31.78,0:19:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it is, the legendary sacred wine of Arahasu!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the real deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:36.62,0:19:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is fantastic.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Get these loaded up!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:41.70,0:19:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, about my payment...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.87,0:19:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. How about this?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.42,0:19:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastards! You tricked me!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't got any money for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.09,0:19:54.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good job, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.28,0:19:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.51,0:19:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take aim!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.81,0:20:03.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give that wine back now!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.48,0:20:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wine belongs to the villagers.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.94,0:20:06.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:06.89,0:20:07.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss Lu!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with that girl?! Fire!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand now?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give the wine back!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:26.29,0:20:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Outta the way.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance against her.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.09,0:20:29.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's an elf.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.88,0:20:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little girl, I'm the bodyguard\N for this group of merchants.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.76,0:20:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Chilam, slayer of a hundred men,\N will be your opponent! {I hear chiramu}
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.68,0:20:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive anyone\N who bullies a girl!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.81,0:20:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,K.K.!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.95,0:20:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.07,0:20:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Backup is here.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.45,0:21:03.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I get her?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! Finish them off already!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.06,0:21:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The driver!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.27,0:22:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap! It's the curse!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.25,0:22:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! What the hell are those?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.92,0:22:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I screwed up!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.13,0:22:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Look what you did\N to my house, dammit!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.06,0:22:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, K.K.?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.52,0:22:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.73,0:22:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something like that won't stop me!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.40,0:22:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's coming from the village.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.65,0:22:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It must be the Bacchus statues!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.24,0:23:01.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:11.08,0:23:14.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a grand entrance! Bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.51,0:23:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see them!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.10,0:23:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go first!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.02,0:23:34.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, they're strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.73,0:23:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't working.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.94,0:23:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, what should I do?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.95,0:23:48.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th-That's... something very important!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:48.87,0:23:50.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:53.46,0:23:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:00.29,0:24:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, man...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:02.25,0:24:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.35,0:24:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lu sure is shameless, for a girl. {meaning that she hits the tanuki on their balls? penises? and is not ashamed of it}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.82,0:24:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Driver!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.28,0:24:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, Miss Lu! It seems my paralyzer\N hardly affected you.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:27.12,0:24:28.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, that was a joke!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:28.83,0:24:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, bravo, bravo!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.99,0:24:32.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The villagers! Your Highness!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:33.37,0:24:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, about these wine casks...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.33,0:24:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:36.54,0:24:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This all started when I...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:38.34,0:24:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, well done, Lu.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.00,0:24:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.42,0:24:43.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, very well done indeed.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.13,0:24:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have never been so fortunate.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:46.01,0:24:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.51,0:24:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the ancient legends, we were fairly certain
Dialogue: 99,0:24:53.77,0:24:56.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that the sacred wine was in the temple.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:56.47,0:25:00.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But between that giant lid and the Bacchus\N statues, we couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:00.90,0:25:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And just when you were\N at your wit's end, we showed up.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:05.45,0:25:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we can sell that wine, we'll become\N the richest village on Arahasu in no time.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:12.70,0:25:13.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:25.38,0:25:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We finally found you, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:27.59,0:25:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:28.47,0:25:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's you guys!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:31.93,0:25:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:34.18,0:25:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea who this is?!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:36.68,0:25:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is the most honorable 108th prince of the Galactic Empire!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:39.81,0:25:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Muscat Tylor! {this scene of his showing the stamp of the empire is a massive parody of mito komon: The episode concludes with a brawl in which the unarmed, disguised protagonists defeat a crowd of samurai and gangsters, culminating in the presentation of the inrō that reveals the hero's identity. - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inro}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:42.27,0:25:44.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show him your respect!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:46.90,0:25:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You mean that guy really {\i1}is{\i0} a prince?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:49.82,0:25:52.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? I told you so already!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:52.45,0:25:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Highness. His Majesty is worried about you.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:55.58,0:25:57.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We beg you to restrain yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.29,0:25:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please return to your post.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:59.12,0:26:01.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have a drink\N before we go?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:01.29,0:26:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:02.63,0:26:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you refusing the wine I've poured?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.55,0:26:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, no. Just one cup, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.80,0:26:12.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's not fatal.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:14.06,0:26:16.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a guy!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:16.39,0:26:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Lu, K.K.?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:17.93,0:26:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're taking off!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.02,0:26:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:23.82,0:26:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you have my gratitude!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:25.69,0:26:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.74,0:26:28.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:28.65,0:26:29.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:29.99,0:26:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please take me with you!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.53,0:26:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'd be bad if you didn't have anyone to pilot the ship.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:34.87,0:26:36.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well. Come along.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:47.34,0:26:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:55.35,0:26:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, where are we heading?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:57.77,0:27:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to go somewhere\N with a lot of delicious food!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:00.44,0:27:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to fight monsters\N in my power suit!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:04.36,0:27:07.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to be impatient. \NOur journey has just begun.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:07.03,0:27:08.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're on a cruise across the galaxy!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:08.94,0:27:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, all together!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.40,0:27:12.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.98,0:23:38.73,Sign,,0,0,0,,

